  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p>A Phond Crystal reduces the cutting power of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> blade but solidifies the energy beam, making it more effective at battering down an opponent's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_Rating\" title=\"Shield Rating\">Shield Rating</a>. When you wield an attuned <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> with a Phond Crystal, you deal +1 die of damage when using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> against targets that have an active <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_Rating\" title=\"Shield Rating\">Shield Rating</a> (That is, when the attack's damage would be reduced by SR). </p>",
